                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The Majority passed a budget that is nothing short of reckless, slashing health care, nutrition assistance, and essential services for working families while giving massive tax cuts to billionaires.\n\nI opposed this bill in committee, I opposed it on the floor, and I will continue fighting back. House Republicans are prioritizing tax breaks for billionaires. That\u2019s not fiscal responsibility, that\u2019s a direct attack on working Americans.\n\nI will not stand by while our seniors, children, and families bear the burden of these irresponsible policies that do nothing to build up our communities.\nhttps://t.co/RUfGJxN0V9",
